WEBVTT

00:04:26.626 --> 00:04:30.824
bila kutukatisha sisi kutoka katika dunia yetu.

00:04:30.824 --> 00:04:35.170
Leo,tumeanza kuongelea kuhusu mipaka,

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:37.850
lakini tukiondoa hii mipaka,

00:04:37.850 --> 00:04:41.738
mpaka pekee ni utaobaki ni fikra zetu.

00:04:41.738 --> 00:04:42.986
Asante.

00:04:42.986 --> 00:04:48.071
(Makofi)